Factory Details:
  Rank                     none (0)
  Long-name                FrameLink A/V consumer
  Klass                    Source/Video/Audio
  Description              Composes framelinksrc and framelinkaudiosrc on one coordinated session; separate video_src/audio_src pads, no display or audio device
  Author                   FrameLink

Plugin Details:
  Name                     framelink
  Description              FrameLink native video and serialized PCM transport
  Filename                 <win-home>\dev\framelink-final-final-060c54e4\build\Release\gstframelink.dll
  Version                  0.1.0
  License                  MIT/X11
  Source module            framelink
  Binary package           framelink
  Origin URL               https://github.com/jsuppe/framelink

GObject
 +----GInitiallyUnowned
       +----GstObject
             +----GstElement
                   +----GstBin
                         +----GstFrameLinkAvSrc

Implemented Interfaces:
  GstChildProxy

Element Flags:
  - SOURCE

Pad Templates:
  SRC template: 'audio_src'
    Availability: Sometimes
    Capabilities:
      audio/x-raw
                 format: { (string)S16LE, (string)F32LE } (GstValueList)
                 layout: interleaved (gchararray)
                   rate: [ 8000, 192000 ] (GstIntRange)
               channels: [ 1, 2 ] (GstIntRange)
  
  SRC template: 'video_src'
    Availability: Sometimes
    Capabilities:
      video/x-raw(ANY)
                 format: { (string)BGRA, (string)RGBA, (string)NV12, (string)RGB10A2_LE } (GstValueList)

Element has no clocking capabilities.
Element has no URI handling capabilities.

Pads:
  SRC: 'video_src'
    Pad Template: 'video_src'
  SRC: 'audio_src'
    Pad Template: 'audio_src'

Element Properties:

  async-handling      : The bin will handle Asynchronous state changes
                        flags: readable, writable
                        Boolean. Default: false
  
  audio-format        : Accepted PCM format (S16LE, F32LE)
                        flags: readable, writable, changeable only in NULL or READY state
                        String. Default: "S16LE"
  
  audio-queue-ms      : Hard audio queue budget, not target latency
                        flags: readable, writable, changeable only in NULL or READY state
                        Unsigned Integer. Range: 1 - 2000 Default: 80 
  
  audio-track-id      : Negotiated audio identity, zero when absent
                        flags: readable
                        Unsigned Integer. Range: 0 - 4294967295 Default: 0 
  
  channels            : Accepted PCM channels
                        flags: readable, writable, changeable only in NULL or READY state
                        Unsigned Integer. Range: 1 - 2 Default: 2 
  
  connect-timeout-ms  : Session setup and ready deadline
                        flags: readable, writable, changeable only in NULL or READY state
                        Unsigned Integer. Range: 1 - 60000 Default: 15000 
  
  framerate           : Accepted video frame rate with session=
                        flags: readable, writable, changeable only in NULL or READY state
                        Fraction. Range: 1/1 - 240/1 Default: 30/1 
  
  generation          : Negotiated session generation
                        flags: readable
                        Unsigned Integer64. Range: 0 - 18446744073709551615 Default: 0 
  
  height              : Accepted video height
                        flags: readable, writable, changeable only in NULL or READY state
                        Unsigned Integer. Range: 16 - 8192 Default: 720 
  
  idle-timeout-ms     : Bounded transport idle deadline
                        flags: readable, writable, changeable only in NULL or READY state
                        Unsigned Integer. Range: 1 - 60000 Default: 15000 
  
  latency-ms          : Explicit pipeline latency with session=; zero for transport, set required final-playback buffering explicitly
                        flags: readable, writable, changeable only in NULL or READY state
                        Unsigned Integer. Range: 0 - 10000 Default: 0 
  
  message-forward     : Forwards all children messages
                        flags: readable, writable
                        Boolean. Default: false
  
  name                : The name of the object
                        flags: readable, writable
                        String. Default: "framelinkavsrc0"
  
  native-memory       : Output platform GPU memory (DMABuf, D3D11Memory, FrameLinkAHardwareBuffer) from the ring; with session= the ring defers read release
                        flags: readable, writable, changeable only in NULL or READY state
                        Boolean. Default: false
  
  parent              : The parent of the object
                        flags: readable, writable
                        Object of type "GstObject"
  
  rate                : Accepted PCM rate
                        flags: readable, writable, changeable only in NULL or READY state
                        Unsigned Integer. Range: 8000 - 192000 Default: 48000 
  
  session             : Private current-user local discovery directory (not a secret or URL); unset: use an installed framelink.session.v1 context
                        flags: readable, writable, changeable only in NULL or READY state
                        String. Default: null
  
  session-id          : Negotiated identity, not a secret
                        flags: readable
                        String. Default: null
  
  shared-cpu          : Explicit CPU video copy path; broker context or current-user session= discovery, no native fallback
                        flags: readable, writable, changeable only in NULL or READY state
                        Boolean. Default: false
  
  tracks              : Required track set: audio, video or av; only enabled pads exist
                        flags: readable, writable, changeable only in NULL or READY state
                        String. Default: "av"
  
  video-format        : Accepted video format (BGRA, RGBA, NV12, RGB10A2_LE)
                        flags: readable, writable, changeable only in NULL or READY state
                        String. Default: "BGRA"
  
  video-pool          : Ring images this consumer allocates with session= (0: 4); cover ceil(latency*fps)+2
                        flags: readable, writable, changeable only in NULL or READY state
                        Unsigned Integer. Range: 0 - 16 Default: 8 
  
  video-queue-frames  : Coordinated video queue budget
                        flags: readable, writable, changeable only in NULL or READY state
                        Unsigned Integer. Range: 1 - 16 Default: 2 
  
  video-track-id      : Negotiated video identity, zero when absent
                        flags: readable
                        Unsigned Integer. Range: 0 - 4294967295 Default: 0 
  
  width               : Accepted video width
                        flags: readable, writable, changeable only in NULL or READY state
                        Unsigned Integer. Range: 16 - 8192 Default: 1280 
  

